    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API facilitates the efficient merging of shopping cart items for a seamless user experience. This endpoint allows for the integration of cart contents from different sessions or users into a single unified cart. Typical consumers include ecommerce platforms and checkout systems that aim to enhance user convenience and streamline the purchasing process. By utilizing this API, application developers can ensure that customers retain their selected items across multiple sessions, improving overall customer satisfaction.",
